    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt are delighted to offer for sale this substantial two storey semi detached four bedroomed home extending to 145.55 sq.m (1566 sq.ft) on two levels. Positioned within the now established Stradbally More Residential Development on the edge of Stradbally Village and providing for all of the amenities of the village within short strolling distance. This home is presented to a good standard and is available for immediate occupation. No 23 is located in a quiet corner position overlooking the generous lawned open space providing for an uncluttered aspect. The enclosed rear garden benefits from a southerly sunny aspect where one can relax on the paved patio accessed via patio doors from the dining room perfect for summer entertaining. Stradbally Village and nearby Cove offer a wonderful lifestyle and yet only a short spin from both Dungarvan Town (14.1km) and Waterford City (37.2km).\n\nViewing is strictly by prior appointment with Selling Agents REA Spratt 058-42211 \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n6.00m x 2.00m Timber floor\n\nWC\n2.40m x 1.60m Tiled floor\n\nStudy\n3.00m x 2.30m Timber floor, overlooking lawned open space\n\nSitting Room\n5.25m x 3.50m Timber floor, open fire with detailed surround and marble hearth. Double doors to dining room off and bay window overlooking generously lawned open space\n\nDining Room\n3.50m x 3.35m Timber floor. Patio doors to enclosed private garden via patio paved patio area. Kitchen off\n\nKitchen\n4.50m x 2.60m Tiled floor, generous selection of floor and eye level kitchen units incorporating integrated appliances. Utility off\n\nUtility Room\n2.40m x 1.80m Tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. Fitted units. Door to exterior\n\nBedroom 1\n4.70m x 3.35m Carpet floor, ensuite off\n\nEn-suite\n2.25m x 1.40m Both floors and walls fully tiled, Triton T90 Electric Shower\n\nBedroom 2\n4.65m x 3.20m Carpet floor\n\nBedroom 3\n4.30m x 2.45m Carpet floor\n\nBedroom 4\n4.25m x 2.45m Carpet floor\n\nBathroom\n2.30m x 1.85m Full bathroom suite, Trion Novel SR Electric Shower. Both floors and walls fully tiled\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Vacant and early close of sale can be accommodated.\n- Stira stairs access to attic level.\n- Timber garden shed in rear garden.\n- Gated side access to enclosed rear garden perfect for young children.\n- Ideal commuting distance to a number of surrounding centres.\n- Both Stradbally Cove and Ballyvooney Cove within walking distance.\n- The renowned International Copper Coast UNESCO Global Geopark on the doorstep.\n- Stradbally Village provides for a genuine thriving community spirit having a broad offering to include two primary schools, shop, churches, pubs and sporting facilities.\n- Located less than 6km from the scenic Waterford Greenway.\nAll floor coverings, all window furnishing, all light fittings and all integrated appliances. \n All main services to include mains water and mains sewerage.\nOil fired central heating.\nBroadband available."
      },
